<section>
<h1>Heading
<p>paragraph <i>italic <b>bold <u>underlined</section>
<details open=maybe>
<summary>Summary</summary>
<dl>
<dt>alpha
<dd>value <code>&lt;code&gt;</code>
<dt>beta
<dd><ol start=0 reversed><li>zero<li value=-1>negative<li>last</ol>
</dl>
</details>
